  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Innovation Labs led by youth and women to promote urban environmental rights in Lima</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the learnings of their previous project, DESCO will continue to seek to make visible the demands of the peri-urban neighbourhoods of southern Lima. DESCO will be strengthening links with schools and women&#x2019;s organisations, piloting a new urban environmental innovation lab, which will put forward eight eco-friendly initiatives which they hope will be scalable at district level. This Innovation Laboratory will use the principles of circular economy and will make visible urban-environmental rights, vulnerability mitigation and disaster reduction by generating actions and spaces for intergenerational dialogue, awareness-raising and influencing authorities and public opinion at the local, metropolitan, national and international levels, with a view to promoting the defence of our common home and the voices of the community.</narrative>
  </description>
